{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:36 2026-10-16 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:36 2026-10-16 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:36 2026-10-16 HKT</p><img alt=\"屯門黃金泳灘女子疑遇溺 送院搶救不治。資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e138eb1fce7f9b54d14cbe9e540966b/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20250629_221346089_12.jpg\"/><p>屯門黃金泳灘對開，今日（16日）傍晚6時許，一名女子懷疑遇溺昏迷。救護員接報趕至，將女子送往屯門醫院，可惜最終搶救無效不治。目前女子死因及案發經過仍在調查。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:59:03.596843+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:36:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T17:57:54.682124+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:57:37.740735+00:00","content_hash":"8e55429c11065fc17f5f654781d1dfca889df095752aafbc48e86e0adb846c4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}